    "projection": "Title and sheet use the shared filmClip projection and shared depth in their interaction pass. This is not completion of global cross-group depth/atmosphere.",
    "solver": "Metric limits remain 1.5% for paper. A one-pin rigid rotational null-mode projection resolves letter-face constraints without stretching or rebuilding the rest shape. Dynamic contact velocities are retained on release.",
    "retirement": "Continues through the physical cache to room entry; depth attenuation and recession remove it rather than the earlier proposed 22-second hard cutoff.",
    "artisticOverrides": [
      "Authored initial-condition shooting to the measured letter region.",
      "Single adhesive constraint expires at CUT.peel=13.65s; this is authored contact strength/lifetime, not a simulated adhesive material failure.",
      "Air and material masses use declared normalized art units, not an SI calibrated cloth model."
